  << /ActualText (Marshall Norman is a designer from Dayton\054 Ohio with over 12 years of experience specializing in design systems\054 human centered product design\054 AI systems design\054 and being a full\055stack product design partner\056\nMarshall does his best work when he\031s working as a cross disciplinary partner in product ideation\054 design\054 and execution\056 Knowing the ins and outs of a product to make informed decisions while collaborating and bringing people together is where he excels\056)
